title: 'fix(pgas): charge_pgas benchmark'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    # Description

    This PR fixes the `charge_pgas` benchmark inside the `transaction-payment` pallet which skipped the worst case of a account reap + re-creation post dispatch.

    Closes a [Security Finding](https://intelligence.security.parity.io/finding/individuality-1268-1786709825/6055)

    ## Integration

    Any runtime using `ChargePGAS` must regenerate their `pallet_pgas_allowance` weights.

    ## Review Notes

    The fix was to to set the account balance, `fee` and `actual_fee` to values which trigger a account reap and re-creation post dispatch.
crates:
- name: pallet-pgas-allowance
  bump: patch
